Exception Handling

# Step 1: Real-Life Example se Samjho (Exception Kya Hota Hai?)

> Java me Exception: Program chalte waqt (Runtime) aane wali unexpected error, jis se aapka program crash ho sakta hai.
> Exception Handling: Us error ko catch karna taaki program crash na ho aur aage ka code chalta rahe.

---

### Step 2: Jab Exception Aati Hai Toh Kya Hota Hai? (Bina Handling Ke)

Pehle dekhte hain bina handling ke kya hota hai:

```java
public class UnhandledExample {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println("Line 1: Program Shuru");

        int a = 10;
        int b = 0;
        int result = a / b; // ❌ ArithmeticException! (0 se divide nahi kar sakte)

        System.out.println("Result: " + result); // Ye line kabhi chalegi hi nahi
        System.out.println("Line 2: Program Khatam");
    }
}

```

Output Terminal par:

```text
Line 1: Program Shuru
Exception in thread "main" java.lang.ArithmeticException: / by zero

```

> Program `a / b` par hi crash ho gaya! "Program Khatam" wali line tak pohanch hi nahi paya.

---

### Step 3: Try-Catch se Exception Handle Karo (Stepney Lagao)

Java me exception handle karne ke liye hum `try` aur `catch` block ka use karte hain:

- `try` block: Iske andar wo risk wala code rakho jisme error aa sakti hai.
- `catch` block: Agar `try` me error aayi, toh ye us error ko pakad (catch) lega aur crash hone se bachayega.

#### Code Example:

```java
public class HandledExample {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println("Line 1: Program Shuru");

        try {
            int a = 10;
            int b = 0;
            int result = a / b; // Risk wala code
            System.out.println("Result: " + result);
        } catch (ArithmeticException e) {
            // Error aane par ye block chalega
            System.out.println("❌ Error aayi hai: Zero se divide nahi kar sakte!");
        }

        System.out.println("Line 2: Program Khatam (Crash nahi hua!)");
    }
}

```

Output Terminal par:

```text
Line 1: Program Shuru
❌ Error aayi hai: Zero se divide nahi kar sakte!
Line 2: Program Khatam (Crash nahi hua!)

```

> Dekha? Error aayi, handle hui, aur program smoothly poora chala!

