### Types of Exceptions (Interviews ke liye zaroori)

Java me 2 main types ki exceptions hoti hain:

1. Checked Exceptions (Compile-time):

- Java ka compiler aapko code likhte waqt hi bolta hai ki "Ise handle karo!".
- _Example:_ `FileNotFoundException`, `IOException`, `SQLException`.

2. Unchecked Exceptions (Runtime):

- Compile time par nahi pata chalta, program chalte waqt error aati hai (Aapki galat logic ki wajah se).
- _Example:_ `ArithmeticException` (divide by zero), `NullPointerException`, `ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException`.

