### Summary Table

| Keyword   | Kaam                                             |
| --------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| `try`     | Risk wala code iske andar daalo.                 |
| `catch`   | Error ko handle karne ka code yahan likho.       |
| `finally` | Cleanup code jo har haal me chalega.             |
| `throw`   | Apne logic se exception manual raise/throw karo. |
| `throws`  | Method signature par warning dene ke liye.       |
